  "label": "The man is mapped as a 'genuine dumbass mexican'",
  "description": "The text 'genuine dumbass mexican' is overlaid on the image of the man wearing a sombrero and holding hats. This creates an analogical mapping where the textual label 'genuine dumbass mexican' is projected onto the visual entity 'man', identifying him as an instance of that derogatory stereotype. The sombrero visually anchors the man to Mexican identity, which is then mocked by the text. This mapping is central to the meme's hateful intent, as it equates the man's appearance with the stereotype of unintelligent Mexican people.",
